 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sUZf4qqEafkQ7kNvwE_5Pvs&_nc_oc=AdqEmrrbSC2PboyoVOixpmwSZA7DE5dq6rQ4cmVf6lwIgE40NUnO3LEitN77hjBC7MI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGcjbBcHtuVOkgsXT-NK6nZp68G9wjOZ1tIfwgFk8tOqQ&oe=6A92C001"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIZ7aUDEtTQQ7kNvwHnDerH&_nc_oc=Adqg7-DuqyIudTsfoE_RVnKiI5YtCFLTnByGXd0j3OyZJAttaYbc74py6jmERbARFNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHhtHpzBqWPHfumm50jn9SXy-7T4M8Ibq4GQ7knffx4dQ&oe=6A92CD66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TvBq36iJVoQQ7kNvwFv6BVS&_nc_oc=AdqMV0WZeU8iveMZumsdpExHmYrcEPaAJx98pmqgv-fznynhk9pF0cnvnyAinzmnZnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGD06bEXbXyxqG9o1xVFQkBiwUXFzTXK_V6BRLa9ey0gw&oe=6A92D75C"}, {"fil